And Barney's always looking for these superlatives in this kind of damaged, searching, needy, strange way, needing to feel superlative and special.
巴尼总是在寻找这些至高无上的体验，用这种带点破碎感、寻觅感、渴望感、诡异的方式，渴望去感受那种无与伦比和与众不同。

